# Python Port Plan — Step 01 · Struct Skeleton

## Purpose

Port `week1_baseline/ruby/01_struct_skeleton` to Python, producing
`week1_baseline/python/01_struct_skeleton` that is behaviourally equivalent:
same `Tool`/`Message`/`Context` shapes, same `example.rb` console output
(modulo the language-level `to_s` differences called out below).

This is the second entry in the `docs/plans/python_port/<step>` series (see
[`context.md`](context.md) for the index). `00_config` is done; this step
adds the `Tool`, `Message`, and `Context` data structures on top of it.

